NT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">3. 근무부서: 개발부</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4. 모집인원: 1명</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">5. 지원자격: </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">냉동공조기사 자격증 소지자 또는 건축설비기사 소지자 (졸업생 및 재학생 가능)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">6. 연봉: 1개월~3개월 인턴 후 2500만원 이상</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">7. 4대보험, 기타복리후생(기숙사 제공 가능 등)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">※ 신청기간: </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><u>2010.08.09.(월) 18:00까지</u></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">※ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">신청서류 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">(붙임1.참조_홈페이지)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 이력서, 자기소개서</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 졸업증명서, 성적증명서</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 어학성적(해당자한함), 자격증 사본(해당자한함) 등</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">※ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">신청방법</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">: 신청서류를 이메일, 팩스, 우편으로 제출</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼모음T&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">※ 기타 문의사항은 아래의 연락처로 문의바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDEN